    <profile name="Astartes Banner" id="6772-71fb-2f34-7040" hidden="false" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">units within 6&quot;of any friendly ANCIENTS add 1 to their Leadership. In addition, roll a D6 each time a INFANTRY model is destroyed within 6&quot; of any friendly ANCIENTS, before removing the model as a casualty. On a 4+ that model musters one last surge of strength before succuming to its wounds; it can either shoot with one of its weapons as if it were the Shooting phase, or make a single attack as if it were the Fight phase.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
