    <profile name="Thunderstrike" id="7211-e902-061f-4a69" hidden="false" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">Each time this model has shot, select one enemy MONSTER or VEHICLE unit that was hit by one or more attacks made by this model this phase. Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit makes a ranged attack that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Wound roll.</characteristic>
