    <profile name="Lone Dualists" id="a1e1-2c07-31ca-fde2" hidden="false" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">Once per turn This model when targeted by a ranged attack may make a normal move in any direction, the range is then measured to the new location. (this model cannot have look out sir applied to them)</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Terror Assault" id="496a-fd68-0897-a617" hidden="false" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">While an enemy unit is within 3&quot; of this unit, subtract 2 from the Leadership characteristic of models in that unit. In addition each time this model charges a unit it must take a Leadership test. If they fail this model and any friendly (Reiver unit) attacking this unit has +1 attack for the remainder of combat.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
