              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">In your Movement Phase, Select 1 Model from your army who hasn&apos;t Deployed a Haywire Mine yet this game. Place it down 1&quot; away from your model and 6&quot; away from enemy&apos;s and other mines if a enemy vehicle Moves within 3&quot; of the marker it suffers and automatic hit with the Haywire effect and the mine is removed from play.</characteristic>
