                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">Infiltrator Comms Array: Whilst this unit contains a model with an Infiltrator comms array, if there are any friendly PHOBOS CAPTAINor PHOBOS LIEUTENANTmodels on the battlefield, this unit is always treated as being within range of those models’ Rites of Battle and Tactical Precision abilities.</characteristic>
