          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">In your shooting phase, each time this unit is selected to shoot, if it has not Advanced this turn, it can unleash total obliteration, If it does, select one enemy unit; models in this unit can shoot twice this phase, but they can only make attacks that target that enemy unit(and only if that enemy unit is an eliglbe target for those attacks)</characteristic>
