                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">There are no secrets of flame and fire unknown to this Salamander, and he uses them in battle like no other.You can re-roll the dice to determine the number of attacks made with flame weapons (see Codex: Space Marines) by friendly SALAMANDERS models whilst their unit is within 6&quot; of this Warlord.</characteristic>
