        <profile name="Sigismund&apos;s Hair" id="4b9d-90d7-029a-63ae" hidden="false" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">When this model declares a charge on an enemy character model add 2 to the roll, Remeber a Double 1 is still a auto Fail. Once per game if this model is in combat with a character model you may active this ability if you do so Melee weapons equipped by this model have the Devastating wounds Special Rule.</characteristic>
