        </profile>
        <profile name="Master of Prescience" id="aa73-2467-e513-a29f" hidden="false" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">A Friendly unit holly within 6&quot; benefits in two ways:



once per battle round, 1 of the Stratagems Counter-offensive, Return Fire, Go to Ground or Heroic Intervention may target it for 0CP (you choose)


every attack aimed at this unit suffers −1 to Hit roll</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
